    },
    {
        "Id": 120,
        "ActionId": 121,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lamia",
            "...Do I really have to explain everything?"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 121,
        "ActionId": 122,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Coco",
            "Who the hell are you?!"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 122,
        "ActionId": 123,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lamia",
            "That doesn't concern you. Since you were investigating under the Ascendants' watchful eyes, you can't walk out of here alive."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 123,
        "ActionId": 124,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Coco",
            "What's an Ascendant? What do you mean by their watchful eyes? Did you create the tide?"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 124,
        "ActionId": 125,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lamia",
            "Quit asking so many questions. I can't answer them all at once."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 125,
        "ActionId": 126,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lamia",
            "But one thing is certain. This is providence. So, the world cannot find out yet."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 126,
        "ActionId": 127,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "With that, you hear the sound of an explosion. Coco screams as the stairs collapse."
